/**
 * Deterministic demo dataset for AngkorEV.
 *
 * Usage: npm run db:seed            (refuses in production)
 *
 * The seed resets marketplace tables, then creates:
 *  - 3 tenants (verified, verified, suspended) and 5 platform/staff accounts
 *  - 12 vehicles: 9 published dealer cars, 3 private-seller cars, plus review queue items
 *  - evidence documents (real tiny PDFs in data/private-documents)
 *  - reports generated by the actual rules engine (no fabricated history)
 *  - conversations, favourites, saved searches, offers, appointments, notifications,
 *    moderation cases and audit entries
 */
